:: Pharmacy
<<unset $pharmacyItem>>
<<if $daily.pharm.closed>>
	문에는 "휴업" 표지판이 걸려 있습니다. 문을 당겨보지만 잠겨 있습니다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[돌아간다|Hospital Foyer]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
	<<endevent>>
	당신은 병원 약국 안에 있습니다.

	<<if "pharmNurse" in $per_npc>>
		<<loadNPC 0 "pharmNurse">><<person1>>
		<<if $daily.pharm.seductionResult is "fail">>
			<br>
			<<person>>【이가】 <<his>> 책에서 고개를 든다. "어, 또 왔네." <<He>>【은는】 다시 책을 읽는다.
		<<elseif $daily.pharm.seductionResult is "pass">>
			<<if $daily.pharm.sexResult is "buy">>
				계산대에 있던 <<person>>【이가】 당신을 올려다보더니, 희미하게 얼굴을 붉히며 <<his>> 책으로 돌아간다.
			<<elseif $daily.pharm.sexResult is "embarrassed">>
				계산대에 있던 <<person>>【이가】 당신을 올려다보더니, 씩 웃으며 <<his>> 책으로 돌아간다.
			<<else>>
				계산대에 있던 <<person>>【이가】 당신을 올려다보더니, <<his>> 책으로 돌아간다.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			계산대에 있던 <<person>>【이가】 당신을 올려다보더니, <<his>> 책으로 돌아간다.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<generateRole 0 0 "nurse">><<person1>>
		<<saveNPC 0 "pharmNurse">>
		<<print window.KR.getDescriptionKr($description)>> <<male>> 간호사가 계산대 옆에 앉아 책을 읽고 있습니다.
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if $brothelVending?.status is "set" and $settings.condomLevel gte 1 and !($brothelVending.products % 2)>>
		<br>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[콘돔 대량 구매에 대해 묻는다 (0:15)|Pharmacy Buy Condoms in Bulk]]>><<unset $phase2>><<pass 15>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	선반 위의 물건들을 살펴보니, 몇 가지 흥미로운 것들이 눈에 띕니다.
	<br><br>

	<<if $pharmacyXChangeView is undefined>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "menu">><</if>>
	X-체인지:
	<br>
	<<if $pharmacyXChangeView is "menu">>
		<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link [[그레이 X-체인지를 둘러본다|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "gray">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[핑크 X-체인지를 둘러본다|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "pink">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[블루 X-체인지를 둘러본다|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "blue">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[퍼플 X-체인지를 둘러본다|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "purple">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "pillcure">><<link [[해독제와 검사를 둘러본다|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "support">><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $pharmacyXChangeView is "pink">>
		다른 종류 보기: <<link [[그레이|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "gray">><</link>> | <<link [[블루|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "blue">><</link>> | <<link [[퍼플|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "purple">><</link>> | <<link [[해독제와 검사|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "support">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 베이직 3개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_basic"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 나우|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_now"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 위클리|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_weekly"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 엑스트라 스트렝스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_xtra"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 컨티뉴|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_continue"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 레지스턴스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_resistance"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 브리더|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_breeder"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 하이퍼 퍼틸리티|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_breeder"])>><<set $pharmacyItem.name to "X-Change Pink Hyper Fertility">><<set $pharmacyItem.type to "X-Change Pink Hyper Fertility">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 이노센스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_innocence"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 부풀기|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_swell"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 빔보|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_bimbo"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 컴큐어|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_cumcure"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 시시|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_sissy"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[X-체인지 엑스텐드|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_pink_xtend"]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $pharmacyXChangeView is "blue">>
		다른 종류 보기: <<link [[그레이|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "gray">><</link>> | <<link [[핑크|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "pink">><</link>> | <<link [[퍼플|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "purple">><</link>> | <<link [[해독제와 검사|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "support">><</link>>
