		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 나우|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_now"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 위클리|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_weekly"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 엑스트라 스트렝스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_xtra"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 컨티뉴|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_continue"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 레지스턴스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_resistance"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 불|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_bull"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 하이퍼 퍼틸리티|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_bull"])>><<set $pharmacyItem.name to "X-Change Blue Hyper Fertility">><<set $pharmacyItem.type to "X-Change Blue Hyper Fertility">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 이노센스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_innocence"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 부풀기|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_swell"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 힘보|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_himbo"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 컴큐어|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_blue_cumcure"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[X-체인지 부치|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_butch"]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $pharmacyXChangeView is "purple">>
		다른 종류 보기: <<link [[그레이|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "gray">><</link>> | <<link [[핑크|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "pink">><</link>> | <<link [[블루|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "blue">><</link>> | <<link [[해독제와 검사|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "support">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 베이직 3개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_basic"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 나우|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_now"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 위클리|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_weekly"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 엑스트라 스트렝스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_xtra"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 컨티뉴|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_continue"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 레지스턴스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_resistance"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 브리더|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_breeder"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 퍼플 불|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_bull"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[X-체인지 하이퍼 퍼틸리티|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_purple_breeder"])>><<set $pharmacyItem.name to "X-Change Purple Hyper Fertility">><<set $pharmacyItem.type to "X-Change Purple Hyper Fertility">><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $pharmacyXChangeView is "support">>
		다른 종류 보기: <<link [[그레이|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "gray">><</link>> | <<link [[핑크|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "pink">><</link>> | <<link [[블루|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "blue">><</link>> | <<link [[퍼플|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "purple">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "pillcure">><<link [[X-체인지 해독제|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_antidote"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "pillcure">><<link [[X-체인지 해독제 포르테|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_antidote_forte"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pregnancytesticon>><<link [[X-체인지 검사|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_test"]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $pharmacyXChangeView is "gray">>
		<<run setup.ensureGrayPharmacyItems()>>
		다른 종류 보기: <<link [[핑크|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "pink">><</link>> | <<link [[블루|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "blue">><</link>> | <<link [[퍼플|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "purple">><</link>> | <<link [[해독제와 검사|Pharmacy]]>><<set $pharmacyXChangeView to "support">><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link [[X-체인지 레지스턴스|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_gray_resistance"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link [[X-체인지 컨티뉴|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_gray_continue"]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link [[X-체인지 위클리 연장|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_gray_extension"]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
		/* Weekly picks built in plain JS (dense array; also self-heals a corrupt stored value such as the old sparse "[empty x 2]"). */
		<<run (function () {
			var w = State.variables.weekly; var cur = w.pharmacyGrayStock; var valid = Array.isArray(cur) && cur.filter(function (k) { return typeof k === "string"; }).length === 2; if (valid) { return; }
			var pool = ["xchange_gray_breeder", "xchange_gray_bull", "xchange_gray_hyper_fertility", "xchange_gray_fertility", "xchange_gray_xtend"];
			for (var i = pool.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {var j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1)); var t = pool[i]; pool[i] = pool[j]; pool[j] = t;}
			w.pharmacyGrayStock = [pool[0], pool[1]];
		})()>>
		이번 주 특별 재고:
		<br>
		<<for _grayKey range $weekly.pharmacyGrayStock>>
			<<set _grayLabel to setup.pharmacyItems[_grayKey].name>>
			<<capture _grayKey _grayLabel>>
				<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link _grayLabel "Pharmacy Sale">><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems[_grayKey]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</capture>>
		<</for>>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[그레이 상품 구성이 왜 이렇게 제한적인지 묻는다|Pharmacy Gray Ask]]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	시험 중인 제품:
	<br>
	<<pillicon "premium">><<link [[X-체인지 클론: 휘트니|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $pharmacyItem to setup.pharmacyItems["xchange_clone_whitney"]>><</link>><br>
	<br>

	<<if $player.penisExist>>
		자지 강화제:
		<br>
		<<pillicon "penisReduce">><<link [[자지 축소제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["penis_reduction"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["penis reduction"].owned>></span>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "penisEnlarge">><<link [[자지 성장제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["penis_growth"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["penis growth"].owned>></span>
		<br>
		<<pillicon "penisBlock">><<link [[자지 성장 억제제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["penis_blocker"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["penis blocker"].owned>></span>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	가슴 강화제:
	<br>
	<<pillicon "breastReduce">><<link [[가슴 축소제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["breast_reduction"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["breast reduction"].owned>></span>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "breastEnlarge">><<link [[가슴 성장제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["breast_growth"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["breast growth"].owned>></span>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "breastBlock">><<link [[가슴 성장 억제제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["breast_blocker"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["breast blocker"].owned>></span>
	<br><br>

	엉덩이 강화제:
	<br>
	<<pillicon "bottomReduce">><<link [[엉덩이 축소제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["bottom_reduction"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["bottom reduction"].owned>></span>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "bottomEnlarge">><<link [[엉덩이 성장제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["bottom_growth"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["bottom growth"].owned>></span>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "bottomBlock">><<link [[엉덩이 성장 억제제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["bottom_blocker"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["bottom blocker"].owned>></span>
	<br><br>

	기생충 예방:
	<br>
	<<procedureicon "parasite">><<link [[항기생충 크림 튜브|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "parasite cream">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["Anti-Parasite Cream"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["Anti-Parasite Cream"].owned>></span>
	<br><br>

	개인 용품:
	<br>
	<<schoolicon "infirmary">><<link [[진통제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["painkillers"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills.painkillers?.owned || 0>></span>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "pill">><<link [[항불안제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems.calmoryl)>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["anti-anxiety tablets"]?.owned || 0>></span>
	<br>
	<<icon "sharks-teeth.png">><<link [[수면제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems.sleeping_pills)>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["sleeping pills"]?.owned || 0>></span>
	<br>
	<<icon "cream.png">><<link [[민감도 크림을 산다|Pharmacy Sensitivity Cream]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<icon "hairgel.png">><<link [[윤활제 튜브|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "hairgel">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["lube_tube"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $player.inventory.sextoys["lube tube"]?.length || 0>></span>
	<br><br>

	<<if $prescriptions and ($prescriptions.painkiller or $prescriptions.sleep or $prescriptions.antidepressant)>>
		처방전 창구:
		<br>
		<<if $prescriptions.painkiller>>
			<<if $prescriptions.collected.painkiller>>
				<<ind>><span class="blue">이 처방전의 진통제는 이미 수령했다.</span>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<schoolicon "infirmary">><<link [[진통제를 수령한다|Pharmacy Prescription Collect]]>><<set $prescriptionCollect to "painkiller">><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["prescription painkillers"]?.owned || 0>></span>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<ind>><span class="gold">진통제 처방전: <<= prescriptionDaysLeft("painkiller")>>일 남음.</span>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $prescriptions.sleep>>
			<<if $prescriptions.collected.sleep>>
				<<ind>><span class="blue">이 처방전의 수면제는 이미 수령했다.</span>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<icon "pill-strong.png">><<link [[수면제를 수령한다|Pharmacy Prescription Collect]]>><<set $prescriptionCollect to "sleep">><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["prescription sleeping pills"]?.owned || 0>></span>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<ind>><span class="gold">수면제 처방전: <<= prescriptionDaysLeft("sleep")>>일 남음.</span>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $prescriptions.antidepressant>>
			<<if $prescriptions.collected.antidepressant>>
				<<ind>><span class="blue">항우울제가 추가된 하퍼 의사의 처방전은 이미 수령했다.</span>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<pillicon "pill">><<link [[항우울제 처방전을 수령한다|Pharmacy Prescription Collect]]>><<set $prescriptionCollect to "antidepressant">><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["Dr Harper's prescription"]?.owned || 0>></span>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<ind>><span class="gold">항우울제 처방전: <<= prescriptionDaysLeft("antidepressant")>>일 남음.</span>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	가족 계획:
	<br>
	<<sextoysicon "pump">><<link [[유축기|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "breast pump">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["breast_pump"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $player.inventory.sextoys["breast pump"]?.length || 0>></span>
	<br>
	<<pregnancytesticon>><<link [[임신 테스트기 2개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<unset $phase2>><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["pregnancy_test"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $pregnancyTest || 0>></span>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "fertility">><<link [[임신 촉진제 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["fertility_pills"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["fertility booster"].owned>></span>
	<br><br>

	피임약:
	<br>
	<<if $brothelVending?.status is "set" and $brothelVending.products % 2 and $brothelVending.condomsToRefill gte 10 and $settings.condomLevel gte 1>>
		<<condomicon>><<link [[창관용 콘돔 구매 (0:10)|Pharmacy Buy Condoms in Bulk]]>><<unset $phase2>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $settings.condomLevel gte 1>>
		<<condomicon>><<link [[콘돔 3개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "condom">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["condoms"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $condoms || 0>></span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<pillicon "contraceptive">><<link [[피임약 14개입|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<unset $phase2>><<set $phase2 to "pills">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["contraceptive_pills"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["contraceptive"].owned>></span>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "morningAfter">><<link [[사후 피임약을 요청한다|Pharmacy Morning After pill]]>><<unset $phase2>><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["Morning_After_pill"])>><</link>>
	<br><br>

	콘택트 렌즈:
	<br>
	<<cosmeticsicon "contacts">><<link [[콘택트 렌즈 진열대를 살펴본다|Pharmacy Lenses]]>><<unset $phase2>><</link>>
	<<if !($daily.pharm.impatient gte 3) and $lenses_ordered.length gt 0>>
		<br>
		<<cosmeticsicon "contacts">><<link [[주문한 콘택트 렌즈가 도착했는지 묻는다|Pharmacy Ask If Lenses Delivered]]>><<unset $phase2>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[로비로 돌아간다|Hospital Foyer]]>><<endevent>><<unset $pharmacyXChangeView>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Pharmacy Lenses
유리 진열장 뒤로 다양한 색상의 콘택트렌즈가 전시되어 있습니다. 렌즈를 구매하여 눈 색깔을 바꿀 수 있습니다.
<<if $makeup.owned.eyelenses.length + $makeup.owned.custom_eyelenses.length gt 0>>
	<br>
	소유중인 렌즈 색상:
	<span style="display: inline-block;">
	<<set _lenses to []>>
	<<run $makeup.owned.eyelenses.forEach(colour => {
		const colourClass = colour.replace(/ /g, '-')
		const colourKr = window.colorNameTranslate(colour, "spaced name");
		_lenses.push(`<span @class="'eye-${colourClass}'"><span class="left-iris" style="color:#6E4E11;">${colourKr}</span></span>`);
	})>>
	<<if ($makeup.owned.custom_eyelenses.length gt 0)>>
		<<set _uniqueCustomLenses to [...new Set($makeup.owned.custom_eyelenses)]>> /* Filter out non-unique lenses */
		<<run _uniqueCustomLenses.forEach(lens => {
			const colour = window.colorNameTranslate(lens, "spaced name");
			const colourClass = nullable(nullable($custom_eyecolours.find(c => c.name is colour)).canvasfilter).blend; /* nullable fix to be removed when we can use ?. again */
			if (colourClass){
				_lenses.push(`<span class="eye-custom"><span @style="'color:${colourClass}'">${colour}</span></span>`);
			}
		})>>
	<</if>>

	<<print _lenses.join(", ")>> /* Print the list */
	</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<set _availableColours = ["dark blue", "light blue", "purple", "hazel", "amber", "green", "light green", "lime green", "grey", "light grey", "red", "pink", "brown", "black"].filter(x => !$makeup.owned.eyelenses.includes(x))>>
<<if _availableColours.length == 0>>
		구매 가능한 모든 색상의 콘택트렌즈를 모았다. 더 이상 살 것이 없다.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	각 렌즈 한 쌍의 가격은 <<printprice 20000>>입니다.
	<br>
	<<set _lensChoice = _availableColours[0]>>
	<<for _i, _colour range _availableColours>>
		<<set _colourName to setup.colours.eyes_map[_colour]?.name || setup.colourName(_colour)>>
		<<set _cssColour to setup.colours.eyes_map[_colour]?.csstext || _colour.replace(/ /g, '-')>>
		<label><span @class="'eye-' + _cssColour"><span class="colour-eye" style="color:#6E4E11;"><<print _colourName>></span></span>&nbsp;<<print '<<radiobutton "_lensChoice" "'+_colour+'" ' + (_lensChoice is _colour ? "checked" : "") + '>>'>></label> |
	<</for>>

	<br><br>

	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(20000, "pharmacyContacts")>>
		<<link [[구매해서 집으로 보낸다|Pharmacy Lenses]]>><<money -20000 "pharmacyContacts">><<set $makeup.owned.eyelenses.push(_lensChoice)>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[구매해서 착용한다|Pharmacy]]>><<money -20000 "pharmacyContacts">><<set $makeup.owned.eyelenses.push(_lensChoice)>><<set $makeup.eyelenses = {"left":_lensChoice, "right":_lensChoice}>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="purple">구매할 돈이 부족합니다.</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<link [[맞춤 색상 콘택트렌즈에 대해 문의한다|Pharmacy Ask Custom Lenses]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[돌아간다|Pharmacy]]>><</link>>

:: Pharmacy Ask Custom Lenses
<<if $daily.pharm.impatient gt 2>>
	"이게 누구야." 간호사가 얼굴을 찡그리며 말한다. "나가, 이미 내 시간 충분히 낭비했으니까. 그 같잖은 장난 다 끝냈으면 내일 다시 와."
	<br><br><<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Pharmacy Lenses]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $custom_lenses_already_ordered is 1>>
		"지난번에 주문한 게 마음에 들었으면 좋겠군." 간호사가 말한다. "가격은 알지, 제품 가격 <<printprice 45000>>, 배송비 <<printprice 5000>>. 양쪽 눈을 다른 색으로 고르면 총 <<printprice 95000>>【이】야."
	<<else>>
		"진열된 것 중엔 마음에 드는 게 없나?" 간호사가 묻는다.
		"원하는 색상으로 주문을 넣어줄 수는 있지만, 비용이 두 배가 될 거야. 제품 가격 <<printprice 45000>>에 배송비 <<printprice 5000>> 정도 생각하면 돼. 배송은 하루 정도 걸리고. 양쪽 눈을 다른 색으로 하고 싶으면 총 <<printprice 95000>>【이】야."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(50000, "pharmacyContacts")>>
		<<ind>><<link [[맞춤 색상을 선택한다|Pharmacy Select Custom Lenses]]>><<set $pharmacy_order_colours to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="purple">구매할 돈이 부족합니다.</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(95000, "pharmacyContacts")>>
		<<ind>><<link [[양쪽 눈을 다른 색으로 선택한다|Pharmacy Select Custom Lenses]]>><<set $pharmacy_order_colours to 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif setup.inflation.canAfford(50000, "pharmacyContacts")>>
		<span style="color:#566a9b; cursor:pointer">양쪽 눈을 다른 색으로 선택하기</span> <span class="purple">구매할 돈이 부족합니다.</span>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[돌아간다|Pharmacy Lenses]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Pharmacy Select Custom Lenses
"여기." <<he>>【이가】 태블릿을 건네며 말한다. "색상 팔레트를 사용하면 도움이 될 거야. 원하는 색을 고르면 내가 주문을 넣어주지."
<br><br><br>
<<if $pharmacy_order_colours is 2>>
	<div style="display:inline-block; text-align:center; margin-right:2em; vertical-align:top;">
		왼쪽 눈
		<div id="picker0"></div>
	</div>
	<div style="display:inline-block; text-align:center; vertical-align:top;">
		오른쪽 눈
		<div id="picker1"></div>
	</div>
<<else>>
	<div id="picker0"></div>
<</if>>
<<set _color_lenses_temp>> <!-- used inside colorWheelContactLenses() -->
<<run colorWheelContactLenses()>>
<br><br>
<<link [[주문한다|Pharmacy Order Custom Lenses]]>>
	<<money -50000 "pharmacyContacts">>
	<<set $custom_lenses_already_ordered to 1>>
	<<run $lenses_ordered.push([window.colorNamer(_color_lenses_temp[0].hexString), Time.monthDay.toString() + Time.month + Time.year.toString(), [_color_lenses_temp[0].hexString, _color_lenses_temp[0].hsl["l"] / 500]])>>
	<<if $pharmacy_order_colours is 2>>
		<<money -45000 "pharmacyContacts">>
		<<run $lenses_ordered.push([window.colorNamer(_color_lenses_temp[1].hexString), Time.monthDay.toString() + Time.month + Time.year.toString(), [_color_lenses_temp[1].hexString, _color_lenses_temp[1].hsl["l"] / 500]])>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[돌아간다|Pharmacy]]>><</link>>

:: Pharmacy Order Custom Lenses
"여기 영수증." 간호사가 표를 건네며 덧붙인다. "내일쯤 도착할 테니, 언제든 영수증을 가지고 오면 그날 근무하는 사람이 물건을 건네줄 거야."
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Pharmacy]]>><</link>>

:: Pharmacy Ask If Lenses Delivered
<<if $daily.pharm.impatient is 1>>
	"안녕하세요, 어떻게 도와드..." <<He>>【이가】 얼굴을 찌푸린다. "지난번 일 잊어버린 줄 알았나. 그건 멋진 행동이 아니었어. 네 물건 찾게 해놓고 그냥 가버리면 안 되지. 다시는 그러지 마, 제발."
	<br>당신이 사과하자, <<he>>【은는】 당신의 소포가 도착했는지 확인하러 간다.
<<elseif $daily.pharm.impatient is 2>>
	"이게 누구야?" 간호사가 얼굴을 찡그리며 말한다. "나가, 이미 내 시간 충분히 낭비했으니까. 그 같잖은 장난 다 끝냈으면 내일 다시 와."
	<<set $daily.pharm.impatient to 3>>
<<else>>
	"어떻게 도와드..." <<He>>【이가】 말을 멈춘다. "오, 콘택트렌즈 주문했던 사람이구나. 잠깐만 기다려봐, 자기. 벌써 도착했는지 확인해볼게." 당신은 <<he>>【이가】 뒷방으로 사라지는 것을 지켜본다.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !($daily.pharm.impatient gte 2)>>
	<<loitericon>><<link [[기다린다 (0:15)|Pharmacy Ask If Lenses Delivered 2]]>><<set $daily.pharm.impatient to 0>><<pass 15>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Pharmacy]]>><<set $daily.pharm.impatient to ($daily.pharm.impatient + 1) || 1>><</link>>

:: Pharmacy Ask If Lenses Delivered 2
<<set _received to 0>>
<<set _tmp_length to clone($lenses_ordered.length)>>
<<for _i = 0; _i < $lenses_ordered.length; _i++>>
	<<if Time.monthDay.toString() + Time.month + Time.year.toString() != $lenses_ordered[_i][1]>>
		<<set _received += 1>>
		<<set _spaced_colour_name = window.colorNameTranslate($lenses_ordered[_i][0], "spaced name")>>
		<<run $makeup.owned.custom_eyelenses.push(clone($lenses_ordered[_i][0]))>>
		<<run $custom_eyecolours.push({
			variable: $lenses_ordered[_i][0],
			name: _spaced_colour_name,
			name_cap: _spaced_colour_name.toUpperFirst(),
			csstext: $lenses_ordered[_i][0],
			natural: false,
			lens: true,
			canvasfilter: {
				blend: $lenses_ordered[_i][2][0],
				brightness: +$lenses_ordered[_i][2][1]
			}
		})>>
		<<run $lenses_ordered.deleteAt(_i)>>
		<<run _i-->>
	<</if>>
<</for>>
<<if _received > 0>>
	<<run window.initCustomLenses()>>	/* push custom eyelenses inside setup.colours.eyes */
	<<if _received isnot _tmp_length>>
		<<He>>【은는】 잠시 후 눈에 띄게 헐떡이며 돌아온다. "주문하신 콘택트렌즈 <<if _received > 1>><<print _received>>개<</if>>【은는】 도착했는데, 나머지 <<print (_tmp_length - _received == 1) ? '하나' : _tmp_length - _received>>【은는】 내일 다시 와봐야 할 것 같아." <<he>>【이가】 소포를 건네며 말한다.
	<<else>>
		당신은 간호사가 방에서 작은 소포를 손에 들고 돌아오는 것을 본다. "여기 있어." <<he>>【이가】 당신에게 건네며 말한다.
		<br>
		"문제 있으면 그냥 여기로 다시 와, 자기. 우리가 해결해 줄 테니."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="gold">콘택트렌즈가 든 소포를 집어 든다.</span>
<<else>>
	몇 분 후 <<he>>【이가】 돌아온다. "아직 도착 안 했어, 미안 자기. 내일 다시 와봐. 그때쯤이면 도착해 있을 거야."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Pharmacy]]>><</link>>

:: Pharmacy Prescription Collect
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
<<if "pharmNurse" in $per_npc>><<loadNPC 0 "pharmNurse">><<person1>><</if>>
<<set _collected to collectPrescriptionBox($prescriptionCollect)>>
<<if _collected gt 0>>
	<<He>>【은는】 화면에서 처방전을 확인하고, 계산대 뒤의 잠긴 선반에서 상자 하나를 꺼내 온다.
	<<if $prescriptionCollect is "painkiller">>
		"열 회분입니다. 진열대에 있는 것보다 훨씬 강하니 하루에 두 알 넘게 드시면 안 됩니다."
	<<elseif $prescriptionCollect is "sleep">>
		"열 알입니다. 자기 전에 한 알만, 절대 두 알은 안 됩니다. 너무 자주 쓰면 약 없이는 잠들기가 더 어려워집니다."
	<<else>>
		"하퍼 의사 선생님이 늘 처방하는 알약 열 회분에 항우울제가 추가되었습니다. 하루에 한 알씩 드세요."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>>【은는】 상자를 밀어 건넨다. "처방전이 있으니 무료입니다. 다음 주까지는 이게 전부예요."
	<br><br>

	<<set _prescriptionName to $prescriptionCollect is "painkiller" ? "prescription painkillers" : ($prescriptionCollect is "sleep" ? "prescription sleeping pills" : "doses of Doctor Harper's prescription")>>
	<span class="green">당신은 <<print _prescriptionName>> <<print _collected>>개를 수령했다.</span>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<He>>【은는】 화면을 확인하고 고개를 젓는다. "그 처방전으로 지금 받아 갈 건 없어요."
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<unset $prescriptionCollect>>
<<link [[돌아간다|Pharmacy]]>><</link>>

:: Pharmacy Sensitivity Cream
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
<<if "pharmNurse" in $per_npc>><<loadNPC 0 "pharmNurse">><<person1>><</if>>
간호사가 책을 치운다. "어떤 크림을 찾고 있어요? 민감도를 높이는 거예요, 낮추는 거예요?"
<br><br>
<<link [[민감도를 높이는 크림|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "parasite cream">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["sensitivity_stimulant"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["sensitivity-increasing cream"].owned>></span>
<br>
<<link [[민감도를 낮추는 크림|Pharmacy Sale]]>><<set $phase2 to "parasite cream">><<set $pharmacyItem to clone(setup.pharmacyItems["sensitivity_suppressant"])>><</link>> | 보유: <span class="gold"><<= $sexStats.pills.pills["sensitivity-decreasing cream"].owned>></span>
<br><br>

<<getouticon>><<link [[그만둔다|Pharmacy]]>><</link>>

:: Pharmacy Sale
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
<<wearProp $phase2>>
<<person>>【은는】 당신이 들고 있는 <<print $pharmacyItem.name>>【을를】 본다.
<<set _displayPrice to setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price($pharmacyItem.price) : $pharmacyItem.price>>
<<formatmoney _displayPrice>>
<<switch $pharmacyItem.type>>
	<<case "penis reduction">>
		"_printmoney입니다.<<if !$daily.pharm.seductionResult>> 너무 큰가요, 아니면 그냥 작아지고 싶은 건가요?<</if>>"
	<<case "penis growth">>
