:: Widgets boughtOnce [widget]
<<widget "boughtOnce">>
	<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
<</widget>>

:: Widgets pharmacyAddOwned [widget]
<<widget "pharmacyAddOwned">>
	<<set _amount to Number(_args[0])>>
	<<if !Number.isFinite(_amount) or _amount lte 0>>
		<<run throw new Error(`[Pharmacy] Invalid owned increment for ${V.pharmacyItem?.type}: ${_args[0]}`)>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $pharmacyItem is undefined or $pharmacyItem.type is undefined>>
		<<run throw new Error("[Pharmacy] Missing pharmacyItem while trying to add owned stock.")>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $sexStats is undefined>><<set $sexStats to {}>><</if>>
	<<if $sexStats.pills is undefined>><<set $sexStats.pills to {}>><</if>>
	<<if $sexStats.pills.pills is undefined>><<set $sexStats.pills.pills to {}>><</if>>
	<<if $sexStats.pills.pills[$pharmacyItem.type] is undefined>>
		<<run console.warn(`[Pharmacy] Creating missing pill inventory slot for ${V.pharmacyItem.type}.`)>>
		<<set $sexStats.pills.pills[$pharmacyItem.type] to { owned: 0 }>>
	<<elseif !Number.isFinite($sexStats.pills.pills[$pharmacyItem.type].owned)>>
		<<run throw new Error(`[Pharmacy] Invalid owned count for ${V.pharmacyItem.type}: ${V.sexStats?.pills?.pills?.[V.pharmacyItem.type]?.owned}`)>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $sexStats.pills.pills[$pharmacyItem.type].owned += _amount>>
<</widget>>

:: Pharmacy Seduction
"직접 확인해 보는 게 어때요?" 당신이 카운터 너머로 몸을 더 기울이며 말한다.
<br><br>

<<set $seductiondifficulty to (8888 - ($rng * 20) - ($pharmacyItem.type.includes("growth") ? 500 : 1000))>>
<<seductioncheck>>
<<seductionskilluptext>>
<<seductionskilluse>>

<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired>>
	<<set $daily.pharm.seductionResult to "pass">>
	간호사는 약국 문과 텅 빈 통로를 확인한 뒤 <<his>> 책을 덮는다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 손을 잡고 카운터 뒤로 끌어당긴다.
	<br><br>
	"이리 와." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. <<He>>【은는】 당신을 벽에 밀어붙이고 무릎을 꿇은 채 당신의 <<allBottomsUnderwear>>【을를】 옆으로 젖혀 드러낸다.
	<br><br>

	<<set $sexstart to 1>>
	<<link [[다음|Pharmacy Encounter Sex]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $daily.pharm.seductionResult to "fail">>
	간호사는 당신을 빤히 보다가 웃음을 터뜨린다. 얼굴이 화끈 달아오른다.<<ggstress>><<stress 23>>
	<br><br>
	"시도는 좋았어, <<lass>>【아야】." <<he>>【이가】 상자를 당신 쪽으로 도로 밀며 말한다. "그래서, 살 거야 말 거야?"
	<br><br>

	<<print $pharmacyItem.name>> 한 상자가 테이블 위에 놓여 있다.
	<br><br>

	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford($pharmacyItem.price, "pharmacy")>>
		<<set _displayPrice to setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price($pharmacyItem.price) : $pharmacyItem.price>>
		<<formatmoney _displayPrice>>
		<<link [["결제한다 " + _printmoney|Pharmacy Seduction End]]>><<set $phase to "pay">><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="purple">돈이 부족합니다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[그만둔다|Pharmacy Seduction End]]>><<set $phase to "nevermind">><</link>>
